OL,3,GNEWSACadet leader posed as girl on
OL,4,ASnapchat, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Army Cadets instructor and former
OL,7,Fcouncillor posed as a teenage girl on
OL,8,Fthe messaging app Snapchat to encourage
OL,9,Fboys to send him nude photos, a court
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FRylan Ray, who was a detachment
OL,13,Fcommander for the youth organisation in
OL,14,FPeterborough, went on trial earlier
OL,15,Faccused of 25 sexual offences, many of
OL,16,Fthem involving children.
OL,18,FThe 26-year-old, of Westgate in the
OL,19,Fcity, denies the charges.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
