OL,3,GNEWSACadet leader posed as girl on
OL,4,ASnapchat, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutor Claire Matthews told Ipswich
OL,7,FCrown Court that Ray had created a
OL,8,F"fake persona of a teenage girl" to
OL,9,Fextract embarrassing photos from his
OL,10,Falleged victims.
